</div>
<h3 data-page-node-id="LDvcLcYV57yLGCpS71ucPG">1.3 三条技术主线</h3>
<p data-page-node-id="gWzrw0VWTqnxwvJbZ2xkO6">自监督视觉表示学习的发展可以归为三条主线，它们之间是<strong data-page-node-id="qg6ur6VtCQhEKi2VBmEER6">依次纠错</strong>的关系，而不是并行竞争：</p>
<div class="svg-box" data-page-node-id="FsWfiGTKxzYocQbBipixHV">
<svg viewBox="0 0 880 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-page-node-id="4RBqGUQDXhxlVjDOHJ7QXv">
  <text x="440" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" fill="#0f172a" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="VT6iGgR7gcPiOEDwvGdKKi">自监督视觉表示学习的三条主线</text>
  <!-- line 1 -->
  <rect x="40" y="52" width="180" height="72" rx="9" fill="#ede9fe" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="1.7" data-page-node-id="riW110lcLFhXFHbWDD1nv7"/>
  <text x="130" y="76" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" fill="#6d28d9" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="Ga8NzUU0VlfJKqJlhui7lW">① 代理任务</text>
  <text x="130" y="96" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="EsbDovwJMiWLuLvkYBxVa2">着色 · 拼图 · 旋转</text>
  <text x="130" y="114" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="tOgZBZdHtv8l8v7vflM6qG">2014 – 2019</text>
  <rect x="240" y="52" width="230" height="72" rx="9" fill="#fef2f2" stroke="#dc2626" stroke-width="1.6" data-page-node-id="BJTVJczMdh11mIO77fr2CB"/>
  <text x="355" y="76" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#b91c1c" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="fRCzrihL57Ib7phXsvcZ5X">问题：任务与语义脱钩</text>
  <text x="355" y="96" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="5olMsAHIkYPaeStqYmshCc">模型学到"捷径解"</text>
  <text x="355" y="114" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="Tmn1bBVceVlo5dOPOI1bEq">为任务定制的特征迁移性差</text>
  <line x1="470" y1="88" x2="506" y2="88" stroke="#dc2626" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#ssl-ar)" data-page-node-id="YyNJoRoR8q2ft9OtB0mGLj"/>
  <rect x="510" y="56" width="330" height="64" rx="9" fill="#ffedd5" stroke="#ea580c" stroke-width="1.6" data-page-node-id="y1W0g45azIIDc8f122excw"/>
  <text x="675" y="80" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" fill="#c2410c" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="C8RedQ6D6H4oElqcq8Ka4e">转向"任务无关"的目标：</text>
  <text x="675" y="100" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="5Dp6pHbmY2q1RWNWE1zQRH">同一个样本的不同视角应当一致 —— 对比学习</text>
  <!-- line 2 -->
  <rect x="40" y="152" width="180" height="72" rx="9" fill="#ffedd5" stroke="#ea580c" stroke-width="1.7" data-page-node-id="smkpEU8sD6WudgbPZWL9hH"/>
  <text x="130" y="176" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" fill="#c2410c" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="fEFL0bXFjB8QAFK1SrFnhu">② 对比学习</text>
  <text x="130" y="196" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="bweV8hVxiPxVLDD31FxOOd">正样本拉近 / 负样本推远</text>
  <text x="130" y="214" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="zZAhOf2GiKtgvUjbmYOv1Z">2020 – 2021</text>
  <rect x="240" y="152" width="230" height="72" rx="9" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="1.6" data-page-node-id="yUg48koZW2dkRugENyKnY8"/>
  <text x="355" y="176" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#1d4ed8" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="c5LpobHrGdVWQrbAuAa78D">演进：负样本由多到无</text>
  <text x="355" y="196" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="m9LkNDMdxvlI2oo6xKY2ah">SimCLR / MoCo → BYOL / SimSiam</text>
  <text x="355" y="214" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="zcNTxfDlYw3fwlZcSjXFow">发现：只有正样本也能学会</text>
  <line x1="470" y1="188" x2="506" y2="188" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#ssl-ar)" data-page-node-id="7zSfVcqCUXZqQT4Ls9XZqP"/>
  <rect x="510" y="156" width="330" height="64" rx="9" fill="#d1fae5" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="1.6" data-page-node-id="TDViFKf0ZdWAWnSAWxkl7n"/>
  <text x="675" y="180" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" fill="#047857" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="BBwFKgQb4xiIPyRsHAAGEn">关键机制被识别出来：</text>
  <text x="675" y="200" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="szp9ZUwV3FDPyTUI4CbVCx">stop-gradient 与非对称结构才是防坍缩的核心</text>
  <!-- line 3 -->
  <rect x="40" y="252" width="180" height="42" rx="9" fill="#dbeafe" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="1.7" data-page-node-id="PdabcH3n7b2LmN1A0QJkrd"/>
  <text x="130" y="279" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" fill="#1d4ed8" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="DF8QpJUbGoUgZZPwQEsbMq">③ 自蒸馏与规模化</text>
  <rect x="240" y="246" width="230" height="54" rx="9" fill="#f8fafc" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.5" data-page-node-id="RfHXRSFHZks4wU0oXNELR3"/>
  <text x="355" y="268" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" fill="#334155" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="sYurd5kWOPZITYE9YotwJ3">DINO v1 / v2 / v3</text>
  <text x="355" y="287" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="ETB9P3ED6IOtbecngRjwp6">从方法 → 视觉基础模型</text>
  <line x1="470" y1="272" x2="506" y2="272" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#ssl-ar)" data-page-node-id="KSRBicDAsV18wluxxguZ4T"/>
  <rect x="510" y="244" width="330" height="58" rx="9" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="1.5" data-page-node-id="QGdPtsYZw63IeWs7VSx6k1"/>
  <text x="675" y="266" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#1d4ed8" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="heyO9U21ZsRqC2sqmyqfNL">冻结骨干即可跨任务使用</text>
  <text x="675" y="286" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="QEXd4YNLBrJA4VIy1gEn2X">数据 17 亿 · 参数 67 亿 · 覆盖 60+ 基准</text>
</svg>
</div>
<h3 data-page-node-id="LCHVKM2RVAr7s4lqCHeSOn">1.4 如何判断"学得好不好"</h3>
<p data-page-node-id="IjKj9Wr5RBCDnRtt6v7l4q">自监督没有标签，因此不能用训练损失判断表示质量——损失低只说明代理任务做得好。业界用三种<strong data-page-node-id="JIlypjl8jE0AAHpm5pgxAv">下游评估协议</strong>，各自回答不同问题：</p>
<div class="table-wrap" data-page-node-id="X2Ea7nefmExaipYBeYFZOm">
<table data-page-node-id="oGthAUkKUldqJ08IazYzMc">
<tr data-page-node-id="fs1OkL3mACjxfIsNWDAzm9"><th data-page-node-id="zguzZWwG6WoThqFvrWGElQ">协议</th><th data-page-node-id="HwA5ppZtCkeC9GXornUy4X">做法</th><th data-page-node-id="TCt5Uz9akefKhciELSYnZk">回答的问题</th><th data-page-node-id="ZpUsCXTZZxL74Uwe7S6T49">特点</th></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="ZeQeKkcQwY2MB6iPiCC9gq"><td data-page-node-id="aI7WMB0TnbH1BA4k7ZdEf8"><strong data-page-node-id="3hEN2BN5bUaZVCuudFlBg8">线性探针</strong><br data-page-node-id="q0HJ0KfPl6nM2ZfTdLKRUl">Linear Probe</td><td data-page-node-id="58YzsmAanTGkylsvLkO8nB">冻结编码器，只训练一层线性分类器：$\min_W \mathbb{E}[\ell(Wf_\theta(x), y)]$</td><td data-page-node-id="9VgLy0jmykZTvecBf9OO4P">特征本身是否<em data-page-node-id="pay6K8AFjathxMMrD0Uw7x">线性可分</em></td><td data-page-node-id="hzDS0NwoEDbecnBxLvtd9g">最标准的协议；完全隔离了编码器的贡献</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="4Hbo1ziqpdo1WdvXXBcrd2"><td data-page-node-id="1akslA2az41bt411cQUnub"><strong data-page-node-id="AxbYRYUhqxVuGOUsIS7VU7">kNN</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="jZzGWWfUEDrxP7lvbLq7JR">冻结特征直接做最近邻检索</td><td data-page-node-id="gs6JWE6m70pbI3xnuR3MFb">特征空间的<em data-page-node-id="WrWQD1RLB3HqeQRKcNAGuc">度量结构</em>是否合理</td><td data-page-node-id="nsqmGYRwJIEJ9gyp1eSfdd">无需训练，反映特征的紧致程度</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="TlsEdyb0awoWWQldKjM7Ww"><td data-page-node-id="gHPpKoFTCloO85fo5WHDue"><strong data-page-node-id="QPKTvdivdCmluSUbpARvOf">微调</strong><br data-page-node-id="GJBeLWFVzvxAUD3MdIrGk0">Fine-tune</td><td data-page-node-id="IHmHc86MLsvUxY6SoUwFb9">整套参数在下游数据上继续训练</td><td data-page-node-id="Q741ADUulx0jalyikPdo4d">特征的<em data-page-node-id="AjEF0sIQDqHPG8pRLYwqAl">可塑性</em>与上限</td><td data-page-node-id="dTItaxeugD20ugoBHLeqtf">精度最高，但混入了下游训练的作用</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<p data-page-node-id="ZtpM4Q47hpaBVfuy3PsYzO">三种协议给出的方法排名<strong data-page-node-id="4wAr2WEJjDJ2v08RgF1WSL">经常不一致</strong>。例如某些方法线性探针强但微调提升有限，另一些相反。这不是评估的缺陷，而是它们确实衡量了不同能力。阅读论文时需要先确认用的是哪一种——本模块后续凡提到精度，均标注协议与配置。</p>
<div class="callout" data-page-node-id="epL7I6HycHyMWq3z2hE6K6"><div class="callout-title" data-page-node-id="0jOAbrnQsggGXAMRek0KIx">为什么线性探针是主流</div>
<p data-page-node-id="nMIPK5opsTrHS2pGp5fztt">线性探针把编码器完全冻结，只用一层线性映射去适配下游任务。这样得到的精度<strong data-page-node-id="Sfz34jHXCDh6DxgXyM0SAe">几乎完全归功于预训练特征的质量</strong>，而不是下游训练的技巧。它也隐含了一个较强的期望：好特征应当是"线性可读"的。这一期望并不总成立（有些特征需要非线性头才能读出语义），所以它并非万能指标。</p>
</div>
<h3 data-page-node-id="GTpE5fo0CWTayRDhd5imat">1.5 本模块的推进顺序</h3>
<p data-page-node-id="DIArVTUnwzDPcsSIu5E4a0">接下来四章按"依次纠错"的历史顺序展开：第 2 章讲早期代理任务与它们失败的原因；第 3 章讲对比学习如何用"正负样本"取代人工任务；第 4 章讲负样本如何被一步步去掉，以及去掉之后为什么模型仍不坍缩；第 5 章讲自蒸馏路线如何把自监督从"一种训练方法"做成"视觉基础模型"。最后第 6 章汇总时间线、公式与方法对照。</p>
</section>

<section id="ch2" data-page-node-id="NAbGM1phsfALA6hnKQzfJm"><h2 data-page-node-id="lMkH5wom2KkU7mpRSQqG5T"><span class="num" data-page-node-id="FBtOFn1PRoOeUIAifGArY3">2</span>早期代理任务：无标签特征学习的初始探索</h2>
<h3 data-page-node-id="bsntUFnklglijXUkSXyVCX">2.1 出发点：标签从数据内部来</h3>
<p data-page-node-id="yAa9YNkUxawA6bRwisTTRX">2014–2019 年间的思路非常朴素：既然人工标注贵，那就<strong data-page-node-id="MXbvAEuhMSHS4fnXJPwX6R">把图像里本来存在的结构当成标签</strong>。灰度图里丢失了颜色，就让模型预测颜色；图像块被打乱了，就让模型还原顺序；图像被旋转了，就让模型判断转了多少度。这些任务的"答案"都由构造方式预先知道，不需要人标注。</p>
<div class="svg-box" data-page-node-id="oJkold5v36q275DVOkSjA5">
