  <text x="774" y="164" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" fill="#047857" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="MfbKGOyCpHDuGjpEG001rN">损失只回传到 θ</text>
  <text x="774" y="184" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="usjgPxgUCZt64bnTdNpnXD">ξ 一侧梯度被切断</text>
  <text x="440" y="320" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#64748b" data-page-node-id="1ARJl15HXiq9qypQZyJmZa">全程没有任何负样本 —— 防坍缩靠的是"非对称性"，而不是"把别人推开"</text>
</svg>
</div>
<h3 data-page-node-id="aDD9zPjkBrfDullAu7LEW5">4.3 为什么不会坍缩：三种解释与它们的证据</h3>
<p data-page-node-id="Z8YvIeKWS1GXgxyx3npBwf">BYOL 为什么有效，在它发表后引发了持续数年的讨论。整理下来有三种解释，且它们的证据强度不同——这一点值得注意，因为它是"自监督理论落后于实践"的一个典型例子。</p>
<div class="table-wrap" data-page-node-id="CizKB7TvQvlPoOyy5ANTs1">
<table data-page-node-id="6CnKrfwiw6p8FX6WDoonMy">
<tr data-page-node-id="lCTfyuREynuDyxHgpxUYRU"><th data-page-node-id="beVb02BoHPtuveFi2GX81Y">解释</th><th data-page-node-id="Kf5mg7S63AypfcCqAqsZSA">核心主张</th><th data-page-node-id="d9WYCHKocHe0IKsFT7Nx3A">支持证据</th><th data-page-node-id="KhYHfcOpcXZSiSvSRcH13J">当前评价</th></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="Kgi2pBT3qmOsQraaPl3uoC"><td data-page-node-id="1EcpMS3Z0S9l0tZzZE5EOW"><strong data-page-node-id="xfKyu3aHcDEGPjMqloQcFz">动量 + 预测器</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="7bXfaqqMiDYPYCwmUXxHKp">BYOL 论文的原始归因：缓慢移动的目标网络提供了一个"稳定的学习目标"，预测器则让两路不对称</td><td data-page-node-id="kxBEfg9sWHruCl4CRbCbux">去掉预测器或把 $\tau$ 设为 0.9（太快）会明显变差</td><td data-page-node-id="Mcw6ydWCca6x2NESzKMx88">部分正确，但把功劳过多归给了 EMA</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="jHlYBrndHNuie1rf87avhX"><td data-page-node-id="7uSiESxefGC1e9Lm7LxM1W"><strong data-page-node-id="dGbDbd5OoSP5fEA9bQoLxr">停止梯度</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="m42HikTeBDSj1rlYSybGjV">关键在于目标一侧<em data-page-node-id="OoIRIcb1GQC3QXl31xjXNA">不接收梯度</em>——这才是打破"同时把两边拉平到常数"这一平凡解的机制</td><td data-page-node-id="uAXx6WCkJbgyaXC5DyA9h0">SimSiam 去掉 EMA 后仍不坍缩；SimSiam 去掉 stop-gradient 后<strong data-page-node-id="rplL4Lpzw6Vv0qlYZQ9LK0">立刻坍缩</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="2VgRiMQydKU3oGLfSLAcNV">目前证据最强</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="7F7IQwLqg6CsIpFqgLEU9Y"><td data-page-node-id="FuFh7iMguWwg02DcoAt3X7"><strong data-page-node-id="KYONTQ2TjTtp6B8h5zAo72">批归一化</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="Cx90Tyofnt39K4lj2nUQEK">BN 在批内对特征做标准化，隐含地起到了"防止所有样本塌到同一点"的作用</td><td data-page-node-id="dPISqctXyueQroMFV7YbIg">有工作（Richemond 等）证明 BYOL 去掉 batch 统计后仍能工作</td><td data-page-node-id="3NYADvUBM1v12brjUHHBBa">不是必要条件，但确实有辅助作用</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div class="callout" data-page-node-id="kgNqDV0AGu0q3H4uOXG5f9"><div class="callout-title" data-page-node-id="LCxKcAU32RYm9KroZUwrK1">一个值得记住的科学方法观察</div>
<p data-page-node-id="kg4EaV1q9sQDx6TonZhF7R">这场讨论的走向很有教育意义：BYOL 的原始解释（EMA + 预测器）来自<strong data-page-node-id="xVG8tekmoLNUeCO9eqyIBu">消融实验</strong>——去掉某组件变差，就归因给它。但 SimSiam 通过<strong data-page-node-id="cP4APJohlQRs1KZOWDqRlU">构造一个反例</strong>（去掉 EMA 依然有效）证明这个归因不成立。这说明：<em data-page-node-id="Olyk6e00yDSej2XEOkMtAk">消融实验能证明"必要"，却不足以证明"充分"或"是核心机制"</em>。在自监督领域，理论解释常常滞后于经验发现，读论文时应对"归因"保持审慎。</p>
</div>
<h3 data-page-node-id="x1beqDtNRyUvqhusSR8aEY">4.4 SimSiam：拆到最小的骨架</h3>
<p data-page-node-id="T1bTon5j2OIrc2AEeqlena">SimSiam（2021.01）的目标是把"孪生网络 + 正样本"这条路拆到不能再拆，看看最少需要什么。它的最终形式极其简洁：<strong data-page-node-id="S16VaB4F2t0vIotqSKgyLP">共享权重的孪生网络 + 一个预测器 + stop-gradient</strong>。没有负样本、没有动量编码器、没有 EMA、不需要大 batch。</p>
<div class="formula" data-eq="(13)" data-page-node-id="fcJBEFgoCG5ccoagDN4ngv">$$\mathcal{L}_{\text{SimSiam}} = \frac{1}{2}\,\mathcal{D}\big(p_1,\; \texttt{sg}(z_2)\big) + \frac{1}{2}\,\mathcal{D}\big(p_2,\; \texttt{sg}(z_1)\big), \qquad \mathcal{D}(p,z) = -\frac{\big\langle p,\, z \big\rangle}{\big\|p\big\|\,\big\|z\big\|}$$</div>
<p data-page-node-id="19K2vGmEYYBTfnDBbKOwO5">其中 $p = q_\theta(f_\theta(\tau(x)))$ 是预测器输出，$z = f_\theta(\tau'(x))$ 是另一视图的投影输出，$\texttt{sg}(\cdot)$ 表示 <strong data-page-node-id="TEFJ8rrVfFrxkRC6gCLV1b">stop-gradient</strong>——对括号内的量不计算梯度。两路共享同一个编码器 $f_\theta$，只是各自在对方一侧施加了 $\texttt{sg}$。</p>
<h3 data-page-node-id="mybs6cioHGEKaUPBpSq9N0">4.5 关键机制：stop-gradient 才是防坍缩的核心</h3>
<p data-page-node-id="R0srvxOZ6oKg86tHYm2KK4">SimSiam 的消融实验给出了整个领域最干脆的一组对照：</p>
<div class="table-wrap" data-page-node-id="toNnRDxMGgpGDARCbefa3y">
<table data-page-node-id="APkgLRao9WteVAO5kqunAS">
<tr data-page-node-id="FYX4mTuzy8rEeDqutuudoy"><th data-page-node-id="j17rCpExeAYcmiyqaOLSF3">配置</th><th data-page-node-id="9nX5IzwEwIRY5fe3yYGl7G">结果</th><th data-page-node-id="cJBv3pxA8GcH0aHIlCwpM0">结论</th></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="c2OyAVnoYNZxml2I1HRF6J"><td data-page-node-id="DoeGSplhUCZfXHMQ6uXH2I">完整 SimSiam</td><td data-page-node-id="h0p04sm9WoSBBLaajW5pMR">正常训练，线性探针可达 68.1%（100 epoch，ResNet-50）</td><td data-page-node-id="j1U5JFijuo31D0AJXSL5Hh">基线</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="9MUqAXjEDA3cFqfoUfTXVZ"><td data-page-node-id="pAOHLDvrRI98Z6PfSS2Kik"><strong data-page-node-id="Q0RBuAgFjA60J09WNesH0m">去掉 stop-gradient</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="CxCjKLtPWypTVhudGlgzq0">训练<strong data-page-node-id="4SBbvcHlJGo0aBk1qyYNOM">立刻坍缩</strong>，损失瞬间降到 $-1$（余弦相似度上界），精度降到随机水平</td><td data-page-node-id="cLayJfVQTRbJZ0JrixAieJ">stop-grad 是<strong data-page-node-id="B2yKb0hzuHhPTnjMdaeFnF">不可省</strong>的</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="bjt0C16MXYhuhOJ5MfgT7S"><td data-page-node-id="E0AfS9tZxNy0CCMcy9HTnW">去掉预测器 $q$</td><td data-page-node-id="o398zMEBiZGqsYZuPFby4c">训练不稳定，精度大幅下降</td><td data-page-node-id="ni7wcDcEMeI6OXI8lGWlXv">预测器也很重要，但原因是它引入了必要的非对称</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="bvxt4FHrE07JwatfJlbSw4"><td data-page-node-id="zKpclN2i9VPm0iRBnUzLEG">去掉 EMA、去掉大 batch</td><td data-page-node-id="IUJILT1pyNlN0IeFPRrKF1">基本无影响</td><td data-page-node-id="NCIPzJ9ObzsYaPrZ2APmxa">这两项并非必需（但 EMA 在大规模下仍有益）</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<p data-page-node-id="IWyplsXLqUAiGJC8S63hRR">为什么会这样？一个被广泛接受的解释是把 SimSiam 看作<strong data-page-node-id="AtQEdbW1vQ1pvsfYOkHT5N">一种交替优化（EM 式）过程</strong>：</p>
<div class="formula" data-eq="(14)" data-page-node-id="aPjibXW2vkLOQdPMt5CzDj">$$\textbf{E 步：}\;\; \eta^{t} = \theta^{t} \qquad\qquad \textbf{M 步：}\;\; \theta^{t+1} = \arg\min_{\theta}\; \Big\|\; q_\theta\big(z_\theta\big) \;-\; \texttt{sg}\big(z_{\eta^{t}}\big) \;\Big\|^{2}$$</div>
<p data-page-node-id="DHYNFYoJUyWXSuGryJRSNk">在这种解读下，被 $\texttt{sg}$ 冻结的那一侧充当<strong data-page-node-id="0VtLmHLqYhAvCYjZQuUFhG">当前轮次的目标</strong>（类似 EM 的 E 步确定隐变量），而在线侧则是<strong data-page-node-id="qEXiS9VXMYYO7hR4HQIDml">向目标靠拢的参数更新</strong>（M 步）。若两边同时更新、互相追逐，就会一起滑向"全部输出常数"这一平凡不动点；而固定住一侧，问题就退化为一个普通的回归任务，不存在那个平凡解。</p>
<div class="svg-box" data-page-node-id="qDB7sL48vQLowYaaf2ZeqX">
<svg viewBox="0 0 880 280" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-page-node-id="skLdfTf3ybNtRCL3iiIWZB">
  <text x="440" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" fill="#0f172a" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="G5jaxd7mFQ4sbfvOVC580U">stop-gradient 的作用：有无对照</text>
  <defs data-page-node-id="2uhE1vyN8DRd7W1qj1burX">
    <marker id="ssl-ax" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="6" refX="7" refY="3" orient="auto" data-page-node-id="5GWMcXClzdAU6BZiPLnx46"><polygon points="0 0, 8 3, 0 6" fill="#94a3b8" data-page-node-id="mY8cLM0a0klDLoXzMKPlLR"/></marker>
  </defs>
  <!-- axis -->
  <line x1="70" y1="230" x2="410" y2="230" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.4" data-page-node-id="qyLxmw94BGwLGWojWdAYwk"/>
  <line x1="70" y1="230" x2="70" y2="66" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.4" data-page-node-id="TiBcaH8hzGNM8brn2sYMIG"/>
  <text x="240" y="256" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="YaVdpcoo4POpy49sSHhWLn">训练迭代</text>
  <text x="40" y="150" font-size="11" fill="#475569" transform="rotate(-90 40 150)" data-page-node-id="5IG63BJ7EPByBXVgnqQr39">损失</text>
  <path d="M80 82 C 140 116, 200 148, 260 168 S 360 190, 398 196" fill="none" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2.6" data-page-node-id="tbjiQKUkcwkAQ9y8z8IwwQ"/>
  <text x="300" y="150" font-size="11" fill="#059669" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="CumK8IfCoHdrCU61dpNUL5">有 stop-grad</text>
  <text x="300" y="166" font-size="9.5" fill="#94a3b8" data-page-node-id="zqJ2m37ZZifwJsweOfzbAd">平稳收敛到有意义的解</text>
  <path d="M80 96 C 92 168, 100 208, 112 224 C 140 228, 200 229, 398 229" fill="none" stroke="#dc2626" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-dasharray="7,4" data-page-node-id="GWJSdx7TrkEsszSCeYWWfO"/>
  <text x="150" y="210" font-size="11" fill="#dc2626" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="hJmJrO5zpy610CWUG7dC2k">去掉 stop-grad</text>
  <text x="150" y="226" font-size="9.5" fill="#94a3b8" data-page-node-id="AogreiHSMc0L1kDavEC7tc">数步内坍缩到平凡解</text>
  <!-- right: mechanism -->
  <line x1="440" y1="50" x2="440" y2="252" stroke="#e2e8f0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6,4" data-page-node-id="bA7nRHXO6bkTnnvTZZZmOv"/>
  <text x="660" y="56" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" fill="#7c3aed" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="z5IK5kq4BMyTvyJRr8Pmcv">机制：冻结一侧 = 把"互相追逐"变成"单向回归"</text>
  <rect x="480" y="78" width="340" height="70" rx="8" fill="#fef2f2" stroke="#dc2626" stroke-width="1.5" data-page-node-id="HKH1kBuRvgypv4XEgwqOJN"/>
  <text x="650" y="100" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" fill="#b91c1c" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="Xc6z6xKCAf3IVQ0c0yv8b1">无 stop-grad：两侧同时更新</text>
  <text x="650" y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="fTkYWFMAxpJuhYV04F7STv">A 追 B、B 追 A ⇒ 一起滑向"全输出常数"</text>
  <text x="650" y="138" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#94a3b8" data-page-node-id="5YQL7lhhlvM0r80IIvTFfz">这是该优化问题的平凡不动点</text>
  <rect x="480" y="164" width="340" height="70" rx="8" fill="#ecfdf5" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="1.5" data-page-node-id="KTA1JfSErVUvjGAZ7oN15K"/>
  <text x="650" y="186" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" fill="#047857" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="nDkm3sOruYXxN3VC2E1rBE">有 stop-grad：一侧冻结为目标</text>
  <text x="650" y="206" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="aXtyGLOrjElbvGvT93KNMb">另一侧向它做回归 ⇒ 平凡解被排除</text>
  <text x="650" y="224" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#94a3b8" data-page-node-id="KnFuF04cGSn7wzHTue6Abv">与 EM 的交替优化结构同构</text>
</svg>
</div>
<h4 data-page-node-id="prujC2sGklkKjVQwtpDnBu">实现：SimSiam 的完整损失（约 20 行核心代码）</h4>
<p data-page-node-id="KlJnuJF0Jsutqs0NyyGX7A">下面这段是整个第 4 章的最小可运行骨架。值得对照体会：<strong data-page-node-id="2XxXeT3JtYW1TdwilfDDps">没有负样本、没有动量编码器、没有 EMA，只有 <code data-page-node-id="R9RnTSuKetojNTj62bBv31">detach()</code> 一行实现了 stop-gradient</strong>——而正是这一行决定了模型会不会坍缩。</p>
<div class="code-block" data-page-node-id="FEAJFS8GCT3HRdRyG3LIgH"><div class="code-header" data-page-node-id="z8o9tix1oVFxsVbLA3lw5y">simsiam.py — 孪生网络 + 预测器 + stop-gradient</div><pre data-page-node-id="lGMzumwBA8JGXUsE6ic0lR">
<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="D7Qw0cnhK9BioDAzFA9GAX">import</span> torch
<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="iSCFY6kxo5RX7gjJ0qYghj">import</span> torch.nn <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="4SQhvGUGnlAqqodZiCXwJs">as</span> nn
<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="nXkxcPnSau7OWBf6HisglU">import</span> torch.nn.functional <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="CafV3y7hzwwI9IVKBWibo5">as</span> F

<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="Uj31usm7NmB69BItsSA940">class</span> <span class="cls" data-page-node-id="YpMgEdBqRghtfiGqxlzJZC">SimSiam</span>(nn.Module):
    <span class="str" data-page-node-id="k6fHHQ0Fm88Qp9zdRX4lBT">"""SimSiam 最小骨架：共享编码器 + 投影头 + 预测器，损失用负余弦相似度"""</span>
    <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="EsFE6Sbcmdc8bkV7NovVuB">def</span> <span class="fn" data-page-node-id="hZESIMDAud48Ew8ET2hAbt">__init__</span>(<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="xdBeFVyUhQj4lwIBqiz8WG">self</span>, backbone, feat_dim=<span class="num" data-page-node-id="LE59gauw0zqfUs3UogeYcE">2048</span>, pred_dim=<span class="num" data-page-node-id="stfynKsVrNvUeKpiiHFzCf">512</span>):
        <span class="fn" data-page-node-id="gVJnen1WJlzDP04EnB0HPi">super</span>().<span class="fn" data-page-node-id="dOzl16qQ7NKDBq6UHGbauH">__init__</span>()
        <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="uo3GgNCI3txCeKuQbKTnpK">self</span>.backbone = backbone
        <span class="com" data-page-node-id="SFTAiH8XfK935TRqvPsM2X"># 投影头 g：3 层 MLP，最后一层不带 BN 与 ReLU（SimSiam 的细节）</span>
        <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="Px3QU934MlLY3rHgu3e0Pv">self</span>.projector = nn.Sequential(
            nn.Linear(feat_dim, <span class="num" data-page-node-id="9RVRhi6wEiUeEprb3x8aGn">2048</span>, bias=<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="8p7yEtJffHZYNX4m4PFIWR">False</span>), nn.BatchNorm1d(<span class="num" data-page-node-id="f13yK7CL1JFC4gKNzOKZq1">2048</span>), nn.ReLU(inplace=<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="pSQ5Q7X2SIO0rTLmFNvpBY">True</span>),
            nn.Linear(<span class="num" data-page-node-id="ADHCeVR2OvRJTWBYr3f5qu">2048</span>, <span class="num" data-page-node-id="KrzqweoO9pbuAYUvBRPgIf">2048</span>, bias=<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="wV7rzECBMSaD3B1ESTHGTy">False</span>), nn.BatchNorm1d(<span class="num" data-page-node-id="ji6yBUhZeZGTZkFeIn44yv">2048</span>), nn.ReLU(inplace=<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="Cv54dRS7TuImmCRvTTVYAu">True</span>),
            nn.Linear(<span class="num" data-page-node-id="HSX61HLymDP1BFPn1H0KQB">2048</span>, <span class="num" data-page-node-id="eCBre2eB9GZX3XBjTmiDGR">2048</span>, bias=<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="CS6Q5L68OyVFWUbyyHCpwo">False</span>), nn.BatchNorm1d(<span class="num" data-page-node-id="m5B54b49huPWOXQrk3dfiL">2048</span>, affine=<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="stR8iA2CDlnWdy6NFglZiv">False</span>))
        <span class="com" data-page-node-id="eSq8D2Xy3OdRlydDgf1n5C"># 预测器 q：仅在线侧存在，是引入非对称性的关键</span>
        <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="7NE3LviGEKErZj0BCeAACC">self</span>.predictor = nn.Sequential(
            nn.Linear(<span class="num" data-page-node-id="FGmCyv1s2CAXGor4tiHl6t">2048</span>, pred_dim, bias=<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="MHUqdotfJDtU9IvF7Dszci">False</span>), nn.BatchNorm1d(pred_dim), nn.ReLU(inplace=<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="QFFkADcOsz6naHxyi9MScI">True</span>),
            nn.Linear(pred_dim, <span class="num" data-page-node-id="gJWYrQ6K9BFsEK9kJLjo77">2048</span>))

    <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="59xlQmfrrsVjYdzdXss0FW">def</span> <span class="fn" data-page-node-id="WSoRAkV7LB4O5YIuzfJcEw">forward</span>(<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="N6mVPCRmOqQxmEnPkYwyQa">self</span>, x1, x2):
        <span class="com" data-page-node-id="JrDeCigu9GHiTSDLSBlRPn"># 两路共享同一个编码器（孪生网络）</span>
        z1 = <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="GCdeXY7rmLBPhBAC0RnRDJ">self</span>.projector(<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="LQKlPeEDFkWTIoJ0chUVxD">self</span>.backbone(x1))
        z2 = <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="i47Vtr1wFDFWC7mwwYpAlE">self</span>.projector(<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="wx6tN3JMRdVHoFjkf3bpth">self</span>.backbone(x2))
        p1, p2 = <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="V8by7PMitryDIOGyUD7tqi">self</span>.predictor(z1), <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="N7AXDGub6jwsGhoGyUlhN1">self</span>.predictor(z2)
        <span class="com" data-page-node-id="Q3iUZZQlHkkAnwanRPUseu"># 关键：对方一侧调用 detach()，即 stop-gradient</span>
        <span class="com" data-page-node-id="8O6bvLzkXr7xrygUFiAQw4"># 若不写 detach()，模型会在数步内坍缩到平凡解（余弦相似度恒为 1）</span>
        loss = -<span class="num" data-page-node-id="gVmNwqhXc67U1IfV6eCSKP">0.5</span> * (F.cosine_similarity(p1, z2.<span class="fn" data-page-node-id="BAhLiIDHilyesZjyI7X8qf">detach</span>(), dim=<span class="num" data-page-node-id="LwAaKQBIeSAknnKeit38EA">1</span>).mean()
                       + F.cosine_similarity(p2, z1.<span class="fn" data-page-node-id="R1VbRTqTGf6Yi2nbhLs7AJ">detach</span>(), dim=<span class="num" data-page-node-id="nfdD9fPhLCYWacLBn4I8PL">1</span>).mean())
        <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="vWneGVzwOX7X2MuSkAKh3Y">return</span> loss
</pre></div>
<div class="callout danger" data-page-node-id="rMLQwf9XWdVZG6EHePlTkv"><div class="callout-title" data-page-node-id="QD67vP4cqHgly6fvFmfDCj">把 detach() 去掉会立刻坍缩</div>
<p data-page-node-id="XDwKB8KhJd5vAi6zNrnR1K">把上面两处 <code data-page-node-id="nZCUBOSE1PfeyrQx5ttPzj">.detach()</code> 删掉再训练，会看到损失在几个 step 内就从 $0$ 掉到 $-1$——此时所有样本的投影特征完全相同，模型输出常数，训练彻底失败。这不是"训练不稳定"，而是该优化问题的<strong data-page-node-id="gHxIuZufwXKzCpR6B3vQUA">平凡最优解被激活了</strong>。SimSiam 最重要的贡献正是把这个现象暴露出来并给出解释。</p>
</div>
<h3 data-page-node-id="joPqbvOu9SEgCTluOCv8sS">4.6 从"负样本"到"只用正样本"的演进对照</h3>
<div class="table-wrap" data-page-node-id="oHOjQktbbAc1YOpEl42lJ7">
<table data-page-node-id="4FHmQHesBYJgciRBm5V391">
<tr data-page-node-id="StzpQSYdx2296BOBltEq7U"><th data-page-node-id="uM6GP6CLxJQppRdOo92AQl">方法</th><th data-page-node-id="wkTaJXwD7qj8BzLl0h1nBm">负样本</th><th data-page-node-id="YJ7c1ilZeLl4K2QL6mU3it">目标网络</th><th data-page-node-id="HAVF2Rx1cUShp7o04VqInZ">预测器</th><th data-page-node-id="u7ldUTNvjKkmZNSXsGTqaJ">防坍缩机制</th><th data-page-node-id="TlnILF3yujdeRLq3UsfCDL">ResNet-50 线性探针</th></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="H657VYfYFjTeCYE2FWoVfb"><td data-page-node-id="cxEgwtXLOxIfy47Bwago7k">SimCLR</td><td data-page-node-id="fUDgVkT0AxsPWqCvHWLZjx">需要（同 batch，4096+）</td><td data-page-node-id="XUt9Yc9c1RXlEdNtcQ8YsU">无</td><td data-page-node-id="JB7DvtVDSxHNEIfsp7KZ3p">投影头</td><td data-page-node-id="6OQvJ0V2i3CBZOsCEY2jiW">负样本推开</td><td data-page-node-id="XjjjHuViIOJ0wqm3Yu0DzB">76.5%（4× 宽度，1000 ep）</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="dWejFVDM2sLMgbv5fK7yPV"><td data-page-node-id="V30zXG4QbrqJPjzWSHhPtj">MoCo v2</td><td data-page-node-id="wxlaAQ7VUCvf4DxJ7TwmUH">需要（队列，65536）</td><td data-page-node-id="nEyZ2XnHMVzq8w2eS5kY8N">动量编码器</td><td data-page-node-id="MF4qEezoOtKVfwF8A36EPk">投影头</td><td data-page-node-id="IZ3k52CR9pBeN34bzsedGm">负样本推开 + 队列一致性</td><td data-page-node-id="YE5nwJwov82iBkTz69tiZy">71.1%（800 ep）</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="61iGxsjJxGlI8YtkpysPCB"><td data-page-node-id="pEscJQGsjFfFVQPFD4kVBe">SwAV</td><td data-page-node-id="ybyaBH3UGhPssoRZkR4yNi">不需要显式负样本</td><td data-page-node-id="vzo7WzJADAvFLoKgv18cyz">无</td><td data-page-node-id="UDCZ0bCPsgdr06pH3DwiNE">原型分配</td><td data-page-node-id="DH05iELVVlxnf4nr5lAmlD">聚类均衡约束</td><td data-page-node-id="PbaB2O9TRGr2yr0B7kPJ6J">75.3%（800 ep）</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="Ef5bub1C4pvfU4epfhdhKU"><td data-page-node-id="7rE2aRSiUVtHI7w8bHhqiZ">Barlow Twins</td><td data-page-node-id="4tacamjpM6Pvk4vMRktyDT">不需要</td><td data-page-node-id="xH08jCgZ4LBBUZ19C9LWS6">无</td><td data-page-node-id="G17jEDCD4G7vGqH91CtzRY">投影头</td><td data-page-node-id="3GFqYKC3DF6h5lFqxgDXqD">互相关矩阵趋近单位阵</td><td data-page-node-id="AYIzOlNOXTP8RFr75hEG4I">73.2%（1000 ep）</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="HVMkGlDitSvLdF7SEoA8p3"><td data-page-node-id="GRMewarNpFWUUCw1JnN9fL">BYOL</td><td data-page-node-id="Pg2iz0kgZCzQTJK4TT2TWl"><strong data-page-node-id="ZRR7sNipZ8yjR4jSa4CDkd">不需要</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="rMDuCLadpVCVQHPkLltn4y">EMA 目标网络</td><td data-page-node-id="CcPHyODqSLxPu22EifSYOi"><strong data-page-node-id="d2L4rVvFET0ZjbjGe5enFl">需要</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="ZlgypZP2My28yYNDfck3yD">非对称性 + stop-grad</td><td data-page-node-id="uJb1rpuZYcJKdBOP87ULNw">74.3%（1000 ep）</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="Ozo7RXBzOVKpUHv3iqLsDC"><td data-page-node-id="SEUDfOmEba0I5fFfTXG9c2">SimSiam</td><td data-page-node-id="KOyIAmu7KtHt5QJEG3wvCU"><strong data-page-node-id="UfUKCMRRmGHpbubBCluFwq">不需要</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="njgn4FQehbJLWuNDWMp8N9"><strong data-page-node-id="EvYei88KKnt1QlGEoMc5KO">不需要</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="mAMBP1irPZVdTmPohTG27j"><strong data-page-node-id="ziBOXDZIpMxGe3ob4GB1eu">需要</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="YTlS5BJhoxwSOu5dI0Te9N"><strong data-page-node-id="dYi3iCglxkewOFeE804nSP">stop-gradient</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="H0OLgetVNkEfpLmYBD2skM">71.3%（800 ep）</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="kTq9Zf2YmYwK7hEAzMCjs7"><td colspan="5" data-page-node-id="fgloNaIQ1nHQPCwfjIwIEK"><em data-page-node-id="9XyYrnXKNJxPhgYBm3S6PP">参照：</em>有监督训练 ResNet-50（ImageNet-1k 全监督 top-1）</td><td data-page-node-id="tzb9fjLMVCXvdh7t4g45lX"><em data-page-node-id="Nr1R7rofEbwMjHQBZSKXtA">76.5%</em></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<p data-page-node-id="9Z3lf6i6Jy7EH60o0vE3Yt"><em data-page-node-id="2hCHEsuvJsg59ebShDeVr1">注：表内精度为各论文报告值，配置（epoch 数、网络宽度）已标注；不同配置间不宜直接横向比较数值大小，应看方法族之间的相对趋势。</em></p>
<h3 data-page-node-id="Q5biDFLtpDyuzAyWRjiD6O">4.7 这一章的结论</h3>
<p data-page-node-id="vr0dTCHsCYgDVlSWcLdYAw">把第 3、4 章连起来看，演进链条非常清晰：</p>
<ul data-page-node-id="W068ARy4zMYvGD9kGqLfNQ">
<li data-page-node-id="4Yh1akJhSCndDfAydVWbxl"><strong data-page-node-id="MjYNrDE5h4BV18AaMGDGMs">SimCLR</strong> 证明"极简框架 + 强增广"可行，但把负样本数量与 batch 大小绑死；</li>
<li data-page-node-id="LfHFIb2otdqDJDmcFqra8B"><strong data-page-node-id="DMkZrr14YjoRZ2csfdC4Ml">MoCo</strong> 用队列 + 动量解耦两者，降低显存门槛；</li>
<li data-page-node-id="DhikzEDSb2J96FSMSTEYGJ"><strong data-page-node-id="QOLxUgyL4Xwhe1eJ2a2obt">BYOL</strong> 干脆取消负样本，发现非对称结构（预测器 + EMA 目标）也能防坍缩；</li>
<li data-page-node-id="IvF20ywWSTjuFJ60O50ndh"><strong data-page-node-id="qFt4BYgtxQGiNFSttQdVq1">SimSiam</strong> 继续拆解，指出真正的核心是 <strong data-page-node-id="BvKdCgySV9iFDzhM5ITBZg">stop-gradient</strong>，EMA 与大批次都不是必需的。</li>
</ul>
<p data-page-node-id="NEZanJ86LcyOBxsOGRm21e">这个过程的意义不只是"省掉负样本"：它把防坍缩的机制从<strong data-page-node-id="b08fYtSxHX1Kq0Uk5G4Ran">数据层面</strong>（需要足够多、足够好的负样本）搬到了<strong data-page-node-id="KLNTV2YDvxyJlwH2MkKT5c">优化层面</strong>（对梯度的处理方式）。一旦机制被识别清楚，模型结构就可以大幅简化——这正是第 5 章 DINO 能把自监督推向基础模型规模的前提。</p>
</section>
<section id="ch5" data-page-node-id="F368J8purGKoI12j423p8d"><h2 data-page-node-id="rev7DaWKv5UVA2haovN3Cj"><span class="num" data-page-node-id="rnW2ht5XlLb2ndFgGh2lqh">5</span>DINO v1/v2/v3：从自监督方法到视觉基础模型</h2>
<h3 data-page-node-id="xFDL8kIBukWvDi8iUUd89C">5.1 DINO v1：自蒸馏，并意外获得了物体分割</h3>
<p data-page-node-id="5Z0ipzEm1e0hGdMivPJxow">DINO（2021.04，全称 self-<strong data-page-node-id="1uwegaOpaAR0o75ZCApZEE">DI</strong>stillation with <strong data-page-node-id="PGrMsBXBoMHFUArXvevUE7">NO</strong> labels）建立在前两章结论之上：既然负样本、动量、大批次都可以省，那么"自蒸馏"——<strong data-page-node-id="6v4xnKDCjVetTOZ4F0DfFL">让学生网络去匹配一个由自己演化而来的教师网络的输出分布</strong>——就足以支撑表示学习。它与 BYOL 的关系是：都采用"学生/教师 + EMA"的非对称结构，区别在于<strong data-page-node-id="6iZ1zxEoHxJXB2hGWftjGm">DINO 匹配的是概率分布而非特征向量，且教师只看全局视图、学生要看局部视图</strong>。</p>
<p data-page-node-id="EV10ZKgfDeJTND4hrXz7jC">DINO 的损失是教师与学生在多个视图上的交叉熵：</p>
<div class="formula" data-eq="(15)" data-page-node-id="MxNGYLgqd26v5jU5bA1QrD">$$\min_{\theta_s}\; \sum_{x \in \{x_1^{g},\,x_2^{g}\}} \;\sum_{\substack{x' \in V,\; x' \neq x}} H\Big(P_t(x),\; P_s(x')\Big), \qquad H(a,b) = -\sum_{k} a_k \log b_k$$</div>
<p data-page-node-id="lYT1DMNksWKXcwwAp8BYHk">其中 $V$ 包含 2 个全局视图（$224^2$）与 6 个局部视图（$96^2$）：<strong data-page-node-id="JOv9siGIFKRBtCxqkuT72Y">教师只看全局视图，学生要看全部 8 个</strong>——这构成了一种"局部预测全局"的额外约束，迫使学生从局部块推断整体语义。两个网络的输出分布由温度控制，并在教师一侧加入中心化：</p>
<div class="formula" data-eq="(16)" data-page-node-id="R3b6lpg58Ht1vAch6BETjY">$$P_s(x)^{(k)} = \frac{\exp\big(g_{\theta_s}(x)^{(k)} / \tau_s\big)}{\sum_{j}\exp\big(g_{\theta_s}(x)^{(j)} / \tau_s\big)}, \qquad P_t(x)^{(k)} = \frac{\exp\big(\big(g_{\theta_t}(x)^{(k)} - c^{(k)}\big) / \tau_t\big)}{\sum_{j}\exp\big(\big(g_{\theta_t}(x)^{(j)} - c^{(j)}\big) / \tau_t\big)}$$</div>
<div class="formula" data-eq="(17)" data-page-node-id="SDesWMzsuNTlemOWQfJkbF">$$\theta_t \;\leftarrow\; \lambda\,\theta_t + (1-\lambda)\,\theta_s, \qquad \lambda: 0.996 \to 1.0$$</div>
<div class="callout success" data-page-node-id="GjTEWx9LBAIqRbknatKNrN"><div class="callout-title" data-page-node-id="fNL3SRgsPSCjL1tWtvSvps">中心化与锐化：一对相互对抗的力</div>
<p data-page-node-id="CJJxsuU1nI3pDcNwiCDlWB">DINO 防坍缩的关键是两项看似矛盾的机制。<strong data-page-node-id="NAtCofMJcT00vXLYs9G3ll">中心化</strong>（centering）从教师输出里减去一个滑动平均中心 $c$，作用是<em data-page-node-id="4j7EXnfF3GCOlbGgyqFkar">阻止某一维独占输出</em>（否则模型只需让所有样本在第 $k$ 维上都很高，就"骗过"了损失）；但单独用中心化又会把输出推向<strong data-page-node-id="GiDt4JA0se3ydK1W3rhGu5">均匀分布</strong>——这也是一种坍缩。<strong data-page-node-id="x0qCBYnoFJgFthRfF8Lk9L">锐化</strong>（sharpening）用低温 $\tau_t = 0.04$（学生用 $\tau_s = 0.1$）让分布变尖，正好把均匀化的趋势推回去。</p>
<p data-page-node-id="IQWFTJkwvFiDF7t9BgG9W7">两者必须<strong data-page-node-id="YHTAuiz3PLr5oVynlaBqTE">配套使用并保持平衡</strong>：去掉中心化会维度坍缩，去掉锐化会均匀坍缩。这与第 4 章的"stop-gradient"一样，属于"看起来是超参数、实际上是机制"的设计。</p>
</div>
<p data-page-node-id="xXkY8DZCHMy5LeeZn8dvuI">DINO v1 最被广泛引用的成果，其实不在精度上，而在一个<strong data-page-node-id="7BDahy7wS45Om9QKBEXX7w">意外发现</strong>：训练完成后，模型的<strong data-page-node-id="LDPZFFnoCqBTrss23Ab011">自注意力图会自动勾勒出物体的轮廓</strong>——没有任何分割标签，也不需要任何微调。这个现象说明自监督 ViT 内部自发形成了物体级的空间组织结构，直接启发了后续大量分割工作（以及第 5.4 节要讲的基础模型化方向）。</p>
<h4 data-page-node-id="8gRE5uEOMBGDMnpr1dhEFC">实现：DINO 损失（中心化 + 锐化）</h4>
<p data-page-node-id="DPJRE5IqosxYKKBMFAPEaG">下面这段把公式 (15)(16) 落地。有两个细节容易写错：<strong data-page-node-id="JIstBQF3iPRdzW1gHG7Nx4">中心要用教师的 softmax 前输出更新</strong>（而非概率），且更新必须放在 <code data-page-node-id="oDtQshTx9mHlCSYyKlICnM">no_grad</code> 中——中心是统计量，不应携带梯度。</p>
<div class="code-block" data-page-node-id="hjXFCIk8LGqqCGXQd3BUez"><div class="code-header" data-page-node-id="RDF9moQgs3x2GinT64s0Tt">dino_loss.py — DINO 自蒸馏损失</div><pre data-page-node-id="NhjMRvqk1T666W7HwrGP20">
<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="vYmT3kw3GSggxPNwQtwZLy">import</span> torch
<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="RUtkgJU0ZIOGBaRwKn0dPu">import</span> torch.nn <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="FFn4ozvAxU1paqyGwozYKU">as</span> nn
<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="rizAtbmLsVhXFxZbcLRQ73">import</span> torch.nn.functional <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="Q1acXDCOzy2kkcWBDcUlun">as</span> F

<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="2rRQ961AUGYbtVHRoq1mGD">class</span> <span class="cls" data-page-node-id="186K0XunxV37bLVDKVuZCj">DINOLoss</span>(nn.Module):
    <span class="str" data-page-node-id="v2fB1tDi2swacD92oljSrJ">"""教师做 centering + sharpening，学生匹配教师的输出分布"""</span>
    <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="rDMPSTfq9irPMYbFHVzuDZ">def</span> <span class="fn" data-page-node-id="EJxsH7FK2xhOcAyieA8XNH">__init__</span>(<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="OL2Z7acaxluKNlK8Q6RlmU">self</span>, out_dim=<span class="num" data-page-node-id="NBa5fH20EZhlKQzIwtOEZY">65536</span>, tau_s=<span class="num" data-page-node-id="VvfJZWLqBJ1LT9iXiFt8o2">0.1</span>, tau_t=<span class="num" data-page-node-id="rUo8dUdLZjdtW2CMNCWIIR">0.04</span>, m=<span class="num" data-page-node-id="sFqC2klene43k17Tq3rnZ2">0.9</span>):
        <span class="fn" data-page-node-id="ksSIAUIrCS7yWfrEL3UUQj">super</span>().<span class="fn" data-page-node-id="ZpEa8IgKNepLuhtonCr4KW">__init__</span>()
        <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="VUrjhdk4UFaxxnV0mY4c6T">self</span>.tau_s, <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="kEHMAEHtBBVVsH1plQm7E2">self</span>.tau_t, <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="IBc1D8AHAQAPBnpfrHa15s">self</span>.m = tau_s, tau_t, m
        <span class="com" data-page-node-id="19iJBSB7TodyYQdhkBuU9B"># 中心 c：buffer 而非参数，不参与梯度更新</span>
        <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="qTKwcmyg3nZ13ePLfP9NW1">self</span>.register_buffer(<span class="str" data-page-node-id="A8VnYIEF2zgAtmdb0FgBmr">'center'</span>, torch.zeros(<span class="num" data-page-node-id="ewITmAxvcIYtHzYjLI16Pd">1</span>, out_dim))

    <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="TvD2Ow7heVWuzHHrkBFCpy">def</span> <span class="fn" data-page-node-id="u5P4LDzG4XZIjXk08fbEkP">forward</span>(<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="V1Urh6lSpsS7bMRa0u3pT0">self</span>, student_out, teacher_out):
        <span class="com" data-page-node-id="3j0REOUEAN5AYVyqJlBd9f"># student_out / teacher_out: (B, K)，已过各自的投影头（K = 65536）</span>
        t_logits = teacher_out.<span class="fn" data-page-node-id="PrTJquw0iWPwjmxVwOyxjI">detach</span>()                       <span class="com" data-page-node-id="Hp2eCZu7RfMAisdrVdKH1p"># 教师一侧不回传梯度</span>
        <span class="com" data-page-node-id="pzmGnZUhHRfD7eSoI9xS8T"># 教师分布：先减中心（防某一维独占），再用低温 softmax（锐化）</span>
        t = F.softmax((t_logits - <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="Hl0T5fBm0DnvGkKp3ttQqL">self</span>.center) / <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="1o8WYDSO1ML8Mxw4LUbR89">self</span>.tau_t, dim=-<span class="num" data-page-node-id="z9UPnD0jZPofRX6G3ecdFX">1</span>)
        <span class="com" data-page-node-id="hEIM7aO7xlFVF9G5HJMO4I"># 学生分布：常温 log-softmax，用交叉熵匹配教师</span>
        s = F.log_softmax(student_out / <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="juCHp97hEENfNzfl7Gk4Rw">self</span>.tau_s, dim=-<span class="num" data-page-node-id="EUB9QDirnVTEQ9qiwPv3Sp">1</span>)
        loss = -(t * s).<span class="fn" data-page-node-id="H5cCEPDE0f8UJFIjACkv9s">sum</span>(dim=-<span class="num" data-page-node-id="xSwhWaa30JDpv5lpSTwJ5R">1</span>).mean()
        <span class="com" data-page-node-id="JTBfbvC9wW847hdAqDhJpi"># 用教师的 softmax 前输出更新中心（滑动平均），全程 no_grad</span>
        <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="FI0u7kG68mxD8fREB0DsoZ">with</span> torch.no_grad():
            <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="V2czdJE0tnGgG24IfCA4Ps">self</span>.center.mul_(<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="Kzdej6lxvw2w56HjRoo3Hs">self</span>.m).add_(
                t_logits.mean(dim=<span class="num" data-page-node-id="BUyBuGReEBaOrOunOrgFO5">0</span>, keepdim=<span class="kw" data-page-node-id="EWPufH1QtQV2sSlFen0SKH">True</span>) * (<span class="num" data-page-node-id="MeCtpFL80PQ0oHqanI6PPE">1</span> - <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="6FUVCg19AaaEp6PdJejYpv">self</span>.m))
        <span class="kw" data-page-node-id="QXi9c7VAiOgpR7otvLSXcU">return</span> loss
</pre></div>
<div class="callout" data-page-node-id="mp9umKWc06MO9iMHFlUpT4"><div class="callout-title" data-page-node-id="XW8QQKIEPJ7WMgRGYfSaj6">工程提醒：教师网络的更新方式</div>
<p data-page-node-id="QFRdtmajt9DIU4xAAAjiY0">DINO 的教师网络<strong data-page-node-id="i69kqYFE6JeU0mFVp4DcAN">不参与梯度更新</strong>，而是每步对学生的参数做 EMA（公式 17），动量系数 $\lambda$ 从 0.996 余弦递增到 1.0。实现上通常直接遍历参数做原地平均，并把教师的 BN 统计量一并同步。这一步写错的典型症状是：训练初期看似正常，但中后期教师"跟不上"学生，损失震荡不收敛。</p>
</div>
<h3 data-page-node-id="mXt5kXidbPA1GmuvDiilsK">5.2 DINO v2：把方法做成"基础设施"</h3>
<p data-page-node-id="IZ5lGuhYmxlm3Njm54lq69">DINO v2（2023.04）要解决的问题已经不只是"训得更好"，而是<strong data-page-node-id="rdDMf9IjVjgKkk7oTyPnKH">把自监督做成可直接使用的视觉基础设施</strong>。它针对 v1 的三个不足逐一给出方案：</p>
<div class="table-wrap" data-page-node-id="B7Y2G5jJpfKB3kpvEsUW4l">
<table data-page-node-id="s0QTAN75aQdjoy0skRo3lf">
<tr data-page-node-id="VdeAfd3Vx1o134beB2iHby"><th data-page-node-id="VR3dQ1h58k6OYqg3IRJjQ8">v1 的不足</th><th data-page-node-id="a8tBM3Pd5lKE21RJKH1fX0">v2 的方案</th><th data-page-node-id="VKeVo1yArAxFTC7DILsCVy">设计要点</th></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="VGaMQGxN68LygrJh2e9YoG"><td data-page-node-id="89DpaIEjf0UhwHfXd807mR">训练数据依赖 ImageNet 等有标注数据集</td><td data-page-node-id="JNYQSzHXAeRNnFPctalvwk"><strong data-page-node-id="8OROHkpKO2HvCWlfdQrQRC">LVD-142M 自动筛选</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="yJgDBwzq2RAqgL7UYnfQQY">从 12 亿张未标注图像中，用自监督特征做检索，筛出与若干"种子数据集"分布接近的 1.42 亿张——<em data-page-node-id="faRUHVtDKQ6h2uBhT5yGeC">不引入任何标签</em></td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="3FiuCFKLfZGcYKHe7IK9A5"><td data-page-node-id="f2GhbJw8wfY0DYlkS253Dz">只有图像级特征，patch 级特征质量不足</td><td data-page-node-id="v5NCS5sCkAhOTbxHIk7wT7"><strong data-page-node-id="0dwS4D3k8jy4XVHXQdNHiA">DINO 损失 + iBOT 掩码建模损失</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="iaWRgsDVsBhzRwiLWpVBSE">图像级与 patch 级两个目标联合训练；两者<strong data-page-node-id="e0A6329K0PaGWlsEADykoz">解耦预测头权重</strong>，避免目标冲突</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="A7IGbCQODWOcG38FN8F1zw"><td data-page-node-id="v8b9vCBfX3CytGH8MIawuB">特征分布不均匀，存在离群维度</td><td data-page-node-id="JHfBOXvusi5W5VOBt84cyn"><strong data-page-node-id="82Y4sLr7X6yYJfGYLB0Mel">Sinkhorn 中心化 + KoLeo 正则</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="xROKnFI0Ji7pEu3k9SoYYd">KoLeo 惩罚每个样本与其最近邻距离的对数，使特征在空间中分布更均匀</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="WM4zahumNI15eFWiP9QJNK"><td data-page-node-id="7GfxyzMGenZIFMuBAWpgrv">高分辨率下特征退化</td><td data-page-node-id="6JBjHNecgr2GZvby3TX8nJ"><strong data-page-node-id="R1NKxUvqhd7KUj55kkK66o">高分辨率适配阶段</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="lpQsMtCiAbr9Invdlpe4RJ">先在 224 上预训练，再用较短时间在 518 上适配</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<p data-page-node-id="6S5ibMwpoEGPAGgqiznhwV">KoLeo 正则的形式很简洁，它直接作用于批内特征的最近邻距离：</p>
<div class="formula" data-eq="(18)" data-page-node-id="JtS946uDMBGZHkbjX5Prre">$$\mathcal{L}_{\text{koleo}} = -\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}\log\big(d_i\big), \qquad d_i = \min_{j \neq i}\big\| z_i - z_j \big\|$$</div>
<p data-page-node-id="Z5CZmikkc6MjxkoH45ixOL">直观理解：若某些样本挤在一起（$d_i$ 很小），$-\log d_i$ 就会很大，损失促使其散开。这相当于对特征空间施加了一个<strong data-page-node-id="c9WrGWs8BOfvyeXgSGL28W">"均匀铺开"的软约束</strong>，与对比学习用负样本达到的效果相似，但不需要显式比较样本对。</p>
<p data-page-node-id="rwVzTPpAYOmWsMMB7zMKfr">v2 的工程成果同样重要：它交付了 ViT-S/B/L/g 四个尺寸的模型，并<strong data-page-node-id="TCoCA1xuj70HpyEQddIyWc">把大模型蒸馏成小模型</strong>，使不同算力预算都能使用。其冻结特征在分类、分割、深度估计、检索等多类任务上超过了同期的 CLIP 类弱监督特征——这是"自监督特征能与语言监督特征正面竞争"的标志性结果。</p>
<h3 data-page-node-id="bUT9gqF4LpNe8EdDWvgq9X">5.3 DINO v3：规模与"密集特征退化"问题</h3>
<p data-page-node-id="438ezfqD54B8GnVB7wmqve">DINO v3（2025.08）把 DINO 的配方推到了一个新的量级：<strong data-page-node-id="nNyC02xCHjQrEpfT7m2FG6">ViT-7B/16（约 67 亿参数）、LVD-1689M 约 17 亿张图像</strong>，另有一套约 4.93 亿张的卫星遥感数据用于该领域。但真正值得学习的是它解决的那个<strong data-page-node-id="LmENonZuWEbf2IJw4fBkJ8">技术难题</strong>，因为它暴露了自监督在大规模训练下的一个结构性缺陷。</p>
<p data-page-node-id="tQ8jI6HPMPW4rgLGsPAb9o"><strong data-page-node-id="mrSTsWfxpyqscIq3zV5deO">问题：全局特征在变好，密集特征却在退化。</strong>在超长训练过程中，图像级（全局）表示的指标持续上升，但 patch 级（密集）特征却逐渐"塌陷"——本应互相区分的不同图块开始变得相似。原因是训练目标主要由全局对比/蒸馏驱动，对 patch 之间<strong data-page-node-id="MfoJcM8zYrjZJtr534UMOW">相对关系</strong>的约束很弱。这直接影响分割、深度估计、检测这类需要逐像素输出的任务，而这恰恰是 DINO v2 相对弱于专用系统的领域。</p>
<p data-page-node-id="jNFgcy5WbJ69p2uGilwhjH">解决方案是 <strong data-page-node-id="FgWYuAeyDkRgTBy5jFwGw8">Gram Anchoring</strong>（Gram 锚定）：不直接约束单个 patch 特征，而是约束 patch 特征之间的<strong data-page-node-id="WAhgGDXEyvsh4iaqfg4Upt">相似度结构</strong>。具体做法是把当前模型的 patch 特征 Gram 矩阵拉近一个较早、尚未退化的"Gram 教师"模型的 Gram 矩阵：</p>
<div class="formula" data-eq="(19)" data-page-node-id="DZ4l5eqPVTqdhDcCiUIrjw">$$\mathcal{L}_{\text{Gram}} = \Big\|\, G_\theta(X) \;-\; G_{\theta_{\text{ref}}}(X) \,\Big\|_{F}^{2}, \qquad G_\theta(X) = \tilde{Z}_\theta \,\tilde{Z}_\theta^{\top}, \quad \tilde{Z} = \text{L2 归一化的 patch 特征}$$</div>
<p data-page-node-id="N05Ir522hR5KE7xZkhzrWu">这个设计很巧妙：<strong data-page-node-id="OLTWxeugXbQzYBQIXmGHr3">约束的是相对结构，而非绝对取值</strong>。因此 patch 特征仍然可以自由演化（保留继续学习的空间），只要它们之间的相似度关系保持一致即可。论文报告在约百万次迭代后引入该正则，能快速"修复"已经退化的密集特征，在分割与深度估计上带来显著提升，同时不影响全局性能。</p>
<div class="svg-box" data-page-node-id="vfFLLVPH7DiXUL1CiD0hsC">
<svg viewBox="0 0 880 330" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-page-node-id="msycqDPPnaGAIF3QiYVcF2">
