  <text x="332" y="136" font-size="11" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="4irj5ZJFnJ3qdgLlwVsKNE">· LVD-142M 自动筛选数据集</text>
  <text x="332" y="158" font-size="11" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="CZQOYpO1ZsUdKhIbpBlHyr">· DINO + iBOT 双目标（解耦头）</text>
  <text x="332" y="180" font-size="11" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="myN4W4G0ilcvaM73sPohDL">· Sinkhorn 中心化 + KoLeo 正则</text>
  <text x="332" y="202" font-size="11" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="jPnxyRji7HaOi4WY2GMwen">· registers + 518 高分辨率适配</text>
  <text x="332" y="230" font-size="11" fill="#047857" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="HxOobPLmfZoGlkCwqJ7KBC">成果：冻结特征对标 CLIP</text>
  <text x="332" y="250" font-size="10.5" fill="#94a3b8" data-page-node-id="FF3KCFamjPIdKxzm2BfHTx">规模：ViT-g/14（约 11 亿）</text>
