  <text x="612" y="202" font-size="11" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="EnCArfHsCvM0udOCDt1WTb">· 蒸馏出 ViT 21M ~ 6.7B + ConvNeXt</text>
  <text x="612" y="230" font-size="11" fill="#1d4ed8" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="7yqLPA9KDMXxxfHHnleoJE">成果：冻结骨干在密集任务上</text>
  <text x="612" y="248" font-size="11" fill="#1d4ed8" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="f9WJxNGW46fmKG6kC3ptmL">超过专用模型</text>
  <text x="612" y="270" font-size="10.5" fill="#94a3b8" data-page-node-id="K9vYeJAxKeTiXQ0dga9Ltz">规模：ViT-7B/16（约 67 亿）</text>
</svg>
</div>
<h3 data-page-node-id="MgyXjcJAkPdoDNqlMhGCiG">5.4 基础模型化的三个标志</h3>
<p data-page-node-id="QPTGN9e4dXcgcryqIg2UyK">从 v1 到 v3，自监督视觉模型的性质发生了实质变化。可以用三条标准来判断一个自监督方法是否已经变成"基础模型"：</p>
<ul data-page-node-id="w9UKGNCUy5NQpwDoo5l7ic">
<li data-page-node-id="8nyMCN3HIa3kRoJy6YsFX6"><strong data-page-node-id="D8exzL26Y48mZwDV6q6S0J">骨干可以冻结</strong>。v1/v2 时代仍需要在下游微调；v3 明确以"冻结骨干"为目标——不微调、只接轻量任务头（线性探针或小型 adapter）即可在检测、分割、深度估计、视频跟踪上达到领先水平。这使模型的复用成本大幅下降。</li>
<li data-page-node-id="CKWZZtuApoDWkQiPBPzPoV"><strong data-page-node-id="VDd7whRTRllBxBwbJudkIp">数据的来源与规模独立于标注</strong>。v1 依赖 ImageNet-1k（有标签，虽只用来取图但引入了分布偏置）；v2 用 12 亿未标注图像经检索筛出 1.42 亿；v3 直接扩到约 17 亿，并额外提供了针对遥感领域的专用版本。数据瓶颈从"标注能力"转移到了"算力与筛选管线"。</li>
<li data-page-node-id="PrhiRz28xBSd3CFuydCAB0"><strong data-page-node-id="6qlgNQjz3HX8VuoPwJ46Y2">交付物是一个模型族，而不是一篇论文</strong>。v3 蒸馏出从 2100 万到 67 亿参数的 ViT 序列与若干 ConvNeXt 变体，覆盖端侧到服务端。发布形态从"代码 + 权重"变成了"可直接集成的产品线"。</li>
</ul>
<div class="callout" data-page-node-id="925dEAm5G2EH77I1b0Q87C"><div class="callout-title" data-page-node-id="EKONjissi8zGe6Ye7hfE6C">从 DINO 这条线能学到的两件事</div>
<p data-page-node-id="gceBxIK3X7TFV9czKHsgJf"><strong data-page-node-id="i3gb4U6qvHF9XgqXoFFLvS">其一，"简单方法 + 大规模"往往胜过"精巧方法 + 小规模"。</strong>DINO 的核心组件（双网络、EMA、中心化锐化）在 v1 就已定型，v2 与 v3 的进步主要来自数据管线、正则项与工程细节，而非颠覆性的架构改动。</p>
<p data-page-node-id="vvNNHzp5L9CrmByIL8cKY0"><strong data-page-node-id="bH5pighLhaZ060cwjolAdK">其二，规模会暴露新的失效模式，而这些失效往往无法通过"调参"解决。</strong>v3 的核心贡献 Gram Anchoring 并非为了刷高分类精度，而是修复一个在长训练中<em data-page-node-id="U4va1MHmE4jzDn0gINkneK">才出现</em>的密集特征退化问题。这提示我们：当模型长大之后，"哪些性质会退步"本身就是一个需要被研究的问题。</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="ch6" data-page-node-id="skfgc3lJqRc0zsnT20u2GO"><h2 data-page-node-id="wMr7qTc34s8JffgltvBl3d"><span class="num" data-page-node-id="riOj6tSfVlgGfBCKwgS2fg">6</span>知识体系总结</h2>
<h3 data-page-node-id="wTF3NQ9WXRnWc16sjQy4Jx">6.1 发展时间线</h3>
<div class="timeline" data-page-node-id="dBok6SOlkTQBq68eHdw0QZ">
<div class="timeline-item" data-page-node-id="AHw2dO3T9pbmimQvT7NZ6a"><div class="year" data-page-node-id="28ZAPKvBEQmzCFcdGwMvnf">2014</div><div class="event" data-page-node-id="Y9rFt7MNoyWhWy7PZECQTh">代理任务的起点</div><div class="desc" data-page-node-id="USpAXG7xr1A4EEmFGosAHY">Exemplar CNN 等早期工作提出"用变换构造伪类别"，首次系统尝试不依赖人工标签训练卷积特征</div></div>
<div class="timeline-item" data-page-node-id="vWAz1AqHTZDEnV1E3a8q2z"><div class="year" data-page-node-id="D2N7KxF2SHYhHCLG3sDwLo">2015 – 2016</div><div class="event" data-page-node-id="n60dNjrrcc9mKUZjPVNOgM">代理任务百花齐放</div><div class="desc" data-page-node-id="ylclQX9GfADdBwhXQEqY9Z">Context Prediction（相对位置，2015）、Context Encoder（图像修复）、Colorization（图像着色）、Jigsaw（拼图还原）相继提出，线性探针精度从随机水平提升到 50% 区间</div></div>
<div class="timeline-item" data-page-node-id="a62iolziSb2iuduJoBE9Mw"><div class="year" data-page-node-id="JZSB0iaLizdpAbFvnRmyNL">2018</div><div class="event" data-page-node-id="sNdrTDtqvaOIisHEQNrURG">旋转预测与代理任务的顶峰</div><div class="desc" data-page-node-id="UFwDgg1W7FKEfk9EBb3LOC">Rotation Prediction 以极简实现取得当时最好的迁移表现，成为此后所有对比学习论文的标准对照基线；同时也暴露了"捷径解"问题</div></div>
<div class="timeline-item" data-page-node-id="dD4WbPGI5hNFdEh9FCJ0T5"><div class="year" data-page-node-id="47AsrRsjkeS4EvlfzAnxqe">2020.02</div><div class="event" data-page-node-id="V0WG2SvrFKegTqrxOXbcDC">SimCLR：极简框架 + 强增广</div><div class="desc" data-page-node-id="l6c29d5beSEGb4ny0QpmWQ">用 NT-Xent 与随机裁剪 + 颜色抖动组合，配合 batch 4096 与 LARS，把 ResNet-50(4×) 线性探针推到 76.5%——追平有监督 ResNet-50</div></div>
<div class="timeline-item" data-page-node-id="Pj22CKLsYGjFmTB7en6pr9"><div class="year" data-page-node-id="WBoyCuLkrlr9ZE7OUMuIzU">2020.03</div><div class="event" data-page-node-id="QKmpOyD9Gxs6kENa4hmMr7">MoCo：队列 + 动量编码器</div><div class="desc" data-page-node-id="zo08dI5UwQtG34siPiwFVB">把负样本从"当前 batch"改为"特征队列"，用动量编码器保证队列内特征可比，使小显存也能训练（v2 达到 71.1%）</div></div>
<div class="timeline-item" data-page-node-id="o6OzMbjp8uV6mAN6E4VjB2"><div class="year" data-page-node-id="MBGpjYAmpU3snk2i2GHkoi">2020.06</div><div class="event" data-page-node-id="Isu3XBNlj4qqFTKSvKCq8E">SwAV：用聚类替代样本对</div><div class="desc" data-page-node-id="TsniIOgcNdwZFU6UM7NETq">在线聚类 + 交换预测，不显式比较样本对也能防坍缩，暗示"负样本不是唯一出路"</div></div>
<div class="timeline-item" data-page-node-id="pg5zAcXiyHIstPQKs80xTC"><div class="year" data-page-node-id="CJhd9mE3Lh5GbV3N7YFLzi">2020.06</div><div class="event" data-page-node-id="gJKeD55DxJJFS7MWgjDBbq">BYOL：取消负样本</div><div class="desc" data-page-node-id="MXNvOCD5LgfWsaKidYmesT">用在线/目标双网络 + 预测器 + EMA 实现"只用正样本"，ResNet-50 线性探针 74.3%，引发关于"为什么不会坍缩"的持续争论</div></div>
<div class="timeline-item" data-page-node-id="4zPv8iT6FtVyzWXl9M6zhJ"><div class="year" data-page-node-id="Z32p3Ro6IWx9il1JSjLGT7">2021.01</div><div class="event" data-page-node-id="au4QQer3No3Cg4p1B5veUi">SimSiam：拆到最小骨架</div><div class="desc" data-page-node-id="fO2tavKR4FdClL3xxJBCTR">去掉 EMA 与大批次要求，只保留预测器 + stop-gradient；消融证明 stop-grad 是不可省的，EMA 并非关键</div></div>
<div class="timeline-item" data-page-node-id="4vRP38g5C7bz5OB4ctoP1A"><div class="year" data-page-node-id="UjekYPkHX1tSmPd17DNDrj">2021.03 – 2021.04</div><div class="event" data-page-node-id="UFuY8sasoVZKBVQtrk1DYO">Barlow Twins / VICReg / DINO</div><div class="desc" data-page-node-id="UhDXE6AyF6rBGUIj4St7ip">Barlow Twins 用互相关矩阵趋近单位阵、VICReg 用方差-协方差正则，证明可完全不用负样本；DINO 提出自蒸馏 + 中心化锐化，并意外发现注意力能自动分割物体</div></div>
<div class="timeline-item" data-page-node-id="PIz5f5hmstieibU9eHSCb8"><div class="year" data-page-node-id="KRXnB7L7aiMrGodZW1Hnq5">2023.04</div><div class="event" data-page-node-id="2ecPgRbWVZyTGFrSGuCDST">DINO v2：自监督成为基础设施</div><div class="desc" data-page-node-id="WPXinoFABecQpZzNpTHti1">LVD-142M 无标注数据自动筛选、DINO + iBOT 双目标、KoLeo 正则、registers、518 高分辨率适配；冻结特征在分类与密集任务上对标 CLIP 类弱监督模型</div></div>
<div class="timeline-item" data-page-node-id="BwLNSlw5VicPh0b5GPDBct"><div class="year" data-page-node-id="9IFX5HpmH3wvCeRdaOI1uN">2025.08</div><div class="event" data-page-node-id="G8W241GLlyowaunE9FknDU">DINO v3：规模与新失效模式</div><div class="desc" data-page-node-id="1RFfljpMTHYbERPZK9QhDn">ViT-7B/16（约 67 亿参数）、约 17 亿张图像；提出 Gram Anchoring 修复长训练下的密集特征退化；冻结骨干在 60+ 基准上超过专用系统</div></div>
</div>
<h3 data-page-node-id="xwxd5kFaafXF3VhJGJIwDC">6.2 核心公式速查</h3>
<div class="table-wrap" data-page-node-id="1vOjDrEfGwk8ICfN2rFuXu">
<table data-page-node-id="282bSYNpVGMceLMDDh8BHn">
<tr data-page-node-id="eAfFhscjjC5Ghoe4OmO3SM"><th data-page-node-id="w7Q27h8Fp3AaZnfdYGxUBT">编号</th><th data-page-node-id="HokpvFPxA4ld3DhWK8KcKi">公式</th><th data-page-node-id="sNXoHkuHdIUpbsmTt1CcCq">关键点</th></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="WYKLwHZgMF6Nt63e713csH"><td data-page-node-id="sJqcGdQqSWFUOJnQhyJZEv">(1)(2)</td><td data-page-node-id="etz4HEOQxoT6lZmDYXBbHb">有监督目标 / 自监督的一般形式</td><td data-page-node-id="kPTaglHgx48TFZE4zTEzWa">自监督用两个变换视角自造监督信号</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="ptApqhPtFkonG9AkOhUjZU"><td data-page-node-id="A6ebRBboq8MznU2IxAu1po">(3)(4)(5)</td><td data-page-node-id="ZfIyBOExvsIK3zMKKdVbqU">着色 / 拼图 / 旋转预测</td><td data-page-node-id="FS8NgSHWU8y7yIQy13ZSyL">代理任务的三类典型构造</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="DHPsZO4zTddE5ZZEsj1OQ9"><td data-page-node-id="ySFTWUMNc8GzIS9cK0IKmP">(6)</td><td data-page-node-id="FXLiTOGQHf2o8x2YI8ZrOo">代理任务的根本缺口</td><td data-page-node-id="mbDX0BdVhWcVIWoqPxYIUs">最大化与伪标签的互信息 ≠ 最大化与语义的互信息</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="op6PFaQgDqZAlQ5BBHQ8Wu"><td data-page-node-id="qfjoUzZ3NesuMH12kImAJz">(7)</td><td data-page-node-id="RRABul5Q8qFBR8lCw5naBp">对比目标</td><td data-page-node-id="3ihtQFABgELn2FceD3jqfR">正样本拉近、负样本推远，特征需 L2 归一化</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="UaLLlKU01ENE0icmAqHNKy"><td data-page-node-id="EpCwaELElHOvZuMPbxZ9km">(8)</td><td data-page-node-id="vyoEffHkCsv0pcgOVsxvwS">InfoNCE</td><td data-page-node-id="tFuWA5wQtxcHAHGAqch64d">softmax 形式，分母含全部负样本；$\tau$ 控制尖锐度</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="m4B6Sg14CqVZk0eJ06dxif"><td data-page-node-id="xV5f5WptreMV0trSAJiFEE">(9)</td><td data-page-node-id="GlG8j7ZGpZCLaQK7aQGruz">NT-Xent（SimCLR）</td><td data-page-node-id="czwaQ3t8yfoCcwyulNMGEZ">对称损失，负样本来自同 batch</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="7MF1iVXDtRNRDMFvquIv0H"><td data-page-node-id="bRdD8D90Yq1lfAtlxjPguY">(10)</td><td data-page-node-id="6JnyMdqWrEhDCToEZSSdfy">MoCo 动量更新</td><td data-page-node-id="WE13COA8gHfDeOKOxRzgIK">$m=0.999$，队列提供数量、动量提供一致性</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="CpJ8P7v2QBSemDjhJohUaz"><td data-page-node-id="AntiNkI99npovEhtiNU85p">(11)(12)</td><td data-page-node-id="yT2DfFkHiFOjkAyhSZRzs0">BYOL 损失与 EMA</td><td data-page-node-id="TDKg5bSypVnfC4Aww1wYWC">归一化 MSE；目标网络不接收梯度</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="WQ7LWpxmMYFwMJtRrdlVZh"><td data-page-node-id="igof3Y3ErynL5khiPMIqam">(13)(14)</td><td data-page-node-id="tl4b6sQdsAQfwZ9s1FYPAN">SimSiam 与 EM 视角</td><td data-page-node-id="XUMInEZPA5DVaB5xtur73R">stop-gradient 是防坍缩的核心</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="H4SqSPgRPxprlUqdAhu1YD"><td data-page-node-id="sKto4Fv0RgRlTdHO707sLX">(15)(16)(17)</td><td data-page-node-id="YWoCvvDD530c04Jne7w5A6">DINO 自蒸馏</td><td data-page-node-id="gkq4a9eucp7YVvObFpnX9P">教师只看全局、学生看全局+局部；中心化与锐化相互对抗</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="2HQIQL9T9hFIQsGrtShdfe"><td data-page-node-id="cKeqWS2kTTEilWAiwtQOCg">(18)</td><td data-page-node-id="wvGLXNHi9CAeO0kwOoySQP">KoLeo 正则</td><td data-page-node-id="A0BsCrqChia5ZseSmMdAyi">惩罚最近邻距离的对数，使特征均匀铺开</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="0iB5wtRitDUYMHXkin71AQ"><td data-page-node-id="sOAzKqPtANQLfIw14q8ovH">(19)</td><td data-page-node-id="sxtrrZ6zceb3LPog86u3bN">Gram Anchoring</td><td data-page-node-id="PF967QDbNXDDjOslv5PIPd">约束 patch 相似度结构，修复密集特征退化</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<h3 data-page-node-id="28hB5XOiKHNMIAPngAu7HL">6.3 方法对照表</h3>
<div class="table-wrap" data-page-node-id="EtTtKEYjoPAqeApT9t2ZRB">
<table data-page-node-id="M4wpUlpc8VlF7J0lgtGaUj">
<tr data-page-node-id="ZQCqfWV4TZRs7kYEDZqJKU"><th data-page-node-id="C8Wi7vcDeNZpHPGlrbZf0H">方法</th><th data-page-node-id="7jLnNzqQNYKcNUgONFzan7">年份</th><th data-page-node-id="sEgWYxFGGCwwbb9tWxDAjD">监督信号来源</th><th data-page-node-id="0hq2hBLVANft3MPfjaHipT">是否需负样本</th><th data-page-node-id="hPkUTkQx2LQ0RwMMKHMHbK">防坍缩机制</th><th data-page-node-id="1cBM6pVCRQm7b7iRkVmVme">对后续的影响</th></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="ZLcAMRIGDmqgpiLRZoKVXY"><td data-page-node-id="rrEslDVwhegfKDFjSICeO5">Colorization / Jigsaw / Rotation</td><td data-page-node-id="ZyKnUGjOFd3PLf5A4vU7DT">2016 – 2018</td><td data-page-node-id="g3xkFoMuxego1A6qZZL6Hk">人工设计的代理任务</td><td data-page-node-id="hCbodMlxrrIDAGdUItiwmX">否</td><td data-page-node-id="F5HoyMnDfma06pgOZublJ8">任务本身有非平凡解</td><td data-page-node-id="55gQwHyWPiqM3AtYcI6R5O">确立"无标签预训练"可行性，但受限于捷径解</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="ePkbxFlA4QNZiC65BkNH70"><td data-page-node-id="wbtwi1vCPS2RW421HZRKDw">SimCLR</td><td data-page-node-id="plAcNo0HbGAvW70P3g9IFL">2020.02</td><td data-page-node-id="lENzH3hnTTTaD2Z77WGfFM">同图两视图一致性</td><td data-page-node-id="tXMkTfNo7c7ZCpECJJOIVw">是（同 batch）</td><td data-page-node-id="aoNFtC6RSp7u6t9cbf87tC">负样本推开</td><td data-page-node-id="2EOPoBpDvu0Orb18CRxHJs">确立强增广与投影头的标准地位</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="sfXiADZ31vYhcWPJe4LqrO"><td data-page-node-id="vcyXAzNxsuuAilMVMTLARI">MoCo / v2</td><td data-page-node-id="n027W9lAWhQcgfTrHnAQBR">2020.03</td><td data-page-node-id="CsSiNf5bEYoUik3KX70Esy">同图两视图一致性</td><td data-page-node-id="3Qz6DKYW9GFsmfCBGjf2Xj">是（队列）</td><td data-page-node-id="xD61w4aI1eSN8GJxOQliM3">负样本 + 动量一致性</td><td data-page-node-id="MoIcn4kwK2n8kJ9QndsUoN">解耦负样本数与 batch 大小</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="vpiMiLu3GhH2JBQo3xriqK"><td data-page-node-id="u1qJbuSHxPFp3s4VICwYTc">BYOL</td><td data-page-node-id="LDte4am7iWHsA0zWQCAv7x">2020.06</td><td data-page-node-id="yWxZdnsG38ahgmcUk9geZj">同图两视图一致性</td><td data-page-node-id="SyTZNgg6zC3IIcbsoxc2nb"><strong data-page-node-id="pFClr556FaQrgjJLoNpqy4">否</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="2SWPGFxUOoG7wBcyUPebxZ">非对称 + EMA</td><td data-page-node-id="lFfiqrac2bEAK0EpCg8CNM">打破"必须有负样本"的共识</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="kwN5GQeM2Vjr8lsUZHaW2s"><td data-page-node-id="TB12gw7C8wXhWeaiQ99vku">SimSiam</td><td data-page-node-id="U88zUZBGpjPt1F6zrf0EFi">2021.01</td><td data-page-node-id="zWA5ZywynnLmhIFLFiAn4t">同图两视图一致性</td><td data-page-node-id="SYGmsFSjXSjSL6G4Z0YMqD"><strong data-page-node-id="hLmgQvXPYHJ944oHQQ1ai2">否</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="KD3St8CRMwSbiVvSnCDjEw"><strong data-page-node-id="f1BmFXw4D95uvdWaSGVgDU">stop-gradient</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="BL4PEJrCTkIc9C8dBGA50Z">把防坍缩机制定位到优化层面</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="vIvqISLFDslQLXv6xGSZaT"><td data-page-node-id="Fr68r5eWiyikcaldfMfSLI">Barlow Twins / VICReg</td><td data-page-node-id="yZ2CvVqbinj4jJQcAgzaGE">2021 – 2022</td><td data-page-node-id="LzoFmEGzDX9E5XtANaR4Pq">同图两视图一致性</td><td data-page-node-id="atAL7eE7qCww1dmXGVJGit"><strong data-page-node-id="Bnsmry5SRZvWY7GlowHCAm">否</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="vrTZFaAkyMW7fxOACVS6EE">特征分布正则</td><td data-page-node-id="GR7sUCk9eDkfajknyQGNqq">证明可用纯正则替代负样本</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="cSXKjJGFz95ewyCEoJNDs9"><td data-page-node-id="GDSX5wAoBfz165QKPQgVZ9">DINO v1</td><td data-page-node-id="NXYLAqskU8aAQ7LasElxIl">2021.04</td><td data-page-node-id="cAn1AE271sqjPjTExlwFxW">多视图自蒸馏</td><td data-page-node-id="7TGN4oxhyoGGTZz0UfsoQn"><strong data-page-node-id="O5LCAZ0jf3CjAS7XlnK0qn">否</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="dFK0smYI5dFG5AepVGJW1p">中心化 + 锐化</td><td data-page-node-id="Ye6jdxKiv5gsaLLAZvEXYU">注意力自发分割；成为 v2/v3 的起点</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="JcvlLTVRQ57Aldng6ztFeb"><td data-page-node-id="0IAnu5EzVULYxAtYAFrnPR">DINO v2</td><td data-page-node-id="MRJ7AaDjAwsDRpLi14rJUv">2023.04</td><td data-page-node-id="4xFWP0UrJ0qIF8mFEu9vVX">多视图自蒸馏 + 掩码建模</td><td data-page-node-id="c8hOHqzYU2a2JTsTQA4tZu"><strong data-page-node-id="EsVAUUJWEYEO1ehvAyqMyH">否</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="ccMbeRuSCbHKvdjzEVMRAg">同上 + KoLeo + Sinkhorn</td><td data-page-node-id="WmDIGo2oeUq3mOsFSRRaA4">自监督特征成为通用基础设施</td></tr>
<tr data-page-node-id="qf7CYgGER923kkCDYDsox4"><td data-page-node-id="QSNapDDvPBWSLzVQwknmzi">DINO v3</td><td data-page-node-id="HinqtpCAY9RQYtpXUmS3H7">2025.08</td><td data-page-node-id="adWqAtUrMT2VAIEY5a1P11">同上 + Gram 锚定</td><td data-page-node-id="kqUECcvxaKFkVIoQGzbJ0t"><strong data-page-node-id="MJ9dEb5bVK6T1AJQCxSd9U">否</strong></td><td data-page-node-id="OqBeKA2YBZ8ezCb7lxuTbA">同上 + Gram 正则</td><td data-page-node-id="XU3Y3vGwZAbOj9uGHHCCs4">规模到 67 亿参数；冻结骨干达 SOTA</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<h3 data-page-node-id="NHpRzGTyDyukbN0FatEAwH">6.4 一页知识图谱</h3>
<div class="svg-box" data-page-node-id="jk0DTZacajBIdjAi7YS8wQ">
<svg viewBox="0 0 900 420" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-page-node-id="G4e5VBCFDVhgXwJHCSSMQS">
