  <line x1="262" y1="118" x2="388" y2="176" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5,3" data-page-node-id="F8sULkUpqtID3vOACrLpJh"/>
  <!-- 2 -->
  <rect x="640" y="52" width="212" height="96" rx="9" fill="#fff7ed" stroke="#ea580c" stroke-width="1.6" data-page-node-id="CHfGEKiQFqlvjw482BTaQu"/>
  <text x="746" y="74" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" fill="#c2410c" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="6YmpsZhfGQzkvdJk2DjgPk">② 对比学习（第 3 章）</text>
  <text x="746" y="96" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="LbQ7jiOrF6MYQCWTsrJHX3">InfoNCE · SimCLR · MoCo</text>
  <text x="746" y="114" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="qxavkXdiLYH5rtRZmo5yHL">正样本拉近、负样本推远</text>
  <text x="746" y="136" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#dc2626" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="RS4Eyfftz8x6CeA7IQfvOH">短板：负样本依赖显存与算力</text>
  <line x1="638" y1="118" x2="514" y2="176" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5,3" data-page-node-id="g3pcfKKMND2UNTYhxBMNnG"/>
  <!-- 3 -->
  <rect x="48" y="250" width="212" height="106" rx="9" fill="#ecfdf5" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="1.6" data-page-node-id="aT6dQYiFSUsmShqLEMFXmB"/>
  <text x="154" y="272" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" fill="#047857" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="63QF6PEPCVOZIlcFz8AiTa">③ 只用正样本（第 4 章）</text>
  <text x="154" y="294" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="ZWPaUUzSnzz0dCAcVJK2lV">BYOL · SimSiam · Barlow Twins</text>
  <text x="154" y="312" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="aO2FqthXBIrPcOGAV0egCU">非对称结构 + stop-gradient</text>
  <text x="154" y="334" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#047857" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="s19Pc7joJTgE6bKDlzJpMO">突破：机制从数据层移到优化层</text>
  <line x1="262" y1="290" x2="388" y2="228" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5,3" data-page-node-id="fWrP7K5PEmjkNCpFl5dh3X"/>
  <!-- 4 -->
  <rect x="640" y="250" width="212" height="106" rx="9" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="1.6" data-page-node-id="VcRWRhgvKRt0CwXKYDctlf"/>
  <text x="746" y="272" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" fill="#1d4ed8" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="YMpcqummN5CWmsRKU238PB">④ 自蒸馏与规模化（第 5 章）</text>
  <text x="746" y="294" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="XD6RnYdqhujpBOH8s0PH2v">DINO v1 / v2 / v3</text>
  <text x="746" y="312" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#475569" data-page-node-id="51urdHcnD8a7DkB4MFiTnE">中心化锐化 · LVD 数据 · Gram 锚定</text>
  <text x="746" y="334" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#1d4ed8" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="eauQ3No1ZAqWBWVm7QuwvJ">结果：冻结骨干即基础模型</text>
  <line x1="638" y1="290" x2="514" y2="228" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5,3" data-page-node-id="Jkn5Cn5OfAloXDJkAURy7e"/>
  <!-- bottom -->
  <rect x="300" y="352" width="300" height="54" rx="9" fill="#f8fafc" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.4" data-page-node-id="TMfSI51Fwl5V8ei3Z4gnh5"/>
  <text x="450" y="374" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" fill="#334155" font-weight="700" data-page-node-id="SNJvPGsRezNUj66evUyBef">评估协议：线性探针 · kNN · 微调</text>
  <text x="450" y="394" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#64748b" data-page-node-id="dnEOUhqB0w3t8kVl6odAPO">三者排名常不一致，看结论需先确认协议</text>
  <line x1="450" y1="350" x2="450" y2="246" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5,3" data-page-node-id="u44Wi39h7vWP6f1NqUcynO"/>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="callout success" data-page-node-id="3kXbplEAwIMsduyxptbAzx"><div class="callout-title" data-page-node-id="e8fpcaUguv0ZupmQOrVT4t">一句话总结</div>
<p data-page-node-id="sIqYP8F3SDpsMlVsMf3KIG">自监督视觉表示学习的二十年，可以读作<strong data-page-node-id="y9Uyyyj7BvsnOHEvvCVTdD">一条"不断追问『什么才是好目标』"的纠错链</strong>：代理任务用人工任务造标签，但任务与语义脱钩；对比学习改用"一致性"作目标，却依赖负样本；BYOL / SimSiam 证明负样本可以去掉，并把防坍缩机制定位到 stop-gradient；DINO 系列最终用自蒸馏把这条路线推到基础模型规模——<em data-page-node-id="F7ZVWL3qteJ7LMiKZpVf5P">目标越来越简单，规模越来越大，而"为什么有效"的解释往往滞后于"确实有效"的发现</em>。理解每一次纠错的动机，比记住任何单个方法的细节都更有长期价值。</p>
</div>
</section>

